      "id": 182312,
      "name": "Trajector",
      "username": "Trajector",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-09-14T17:55:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Stories. Anything they do, I’d like to see them add story background to it, like the paragraphs prefacing the weekly one-shots. They don’t have to be complicated, just a little background blurb and maybe an appropriate selection from the card art.</p>\n<p>Actually, on that thought, I would LOVE if they made it so that whenever we compete a step in the unlock process for a variant, a card pops up with some relevant art and a quick story blurb drawing attention to the thing we did and why it’s in the unlock sequence.</p>\n<p>I suppose the theme of my post here is that these sorts of things can be fun, but sometimes they can feel like a grind. I’d rather they be fun!</p>",
